                  {
                    "name": "Description",
                    "$text": "This model can be attached to the following units: \n\n\nAggressor Squad\nEradicator Squad \nEradicator Squad with Heavy Bolters \nHeavy Intercessor Squad \nBladeguard Veteran Squad\nTerminator Squad\nTerminator Assault Squad",
